        "version": "1.0",
        "description": "Single pulse oscillator → open lowpass → punchy fast envelope → light ping-pong delay. Bright, dry, fast-transient mono-style lead chosen so each per-frame arpeggiator step reads cleanly — the canonical chiptune / SID voice for the custom-arp demos.",
