  "song": {
    "name": "Expression & Note-Processor Demo",
    "author": "",
    "description": "A guided walkthrough of Pertylizer's per-note expressions and pattern note-processors. Play from the start. Bars 1-9 (Lead): accent/ghost, gate (staccato→tenuto), vibrato, glide (portamento+glissando), legato (dry→tied), probability (dry→stutter), ornaments. Bars 10-18 (Keys): scale-quantize, chord, chord+strum, chord→arpeggiator and humanize — each processor demo is preceded by a dry \"before\" bar so you hear the contrast. Bars 19-23 (Chip): the custom arpeggiator — SID-style per-frame arps with custom offset cycles ([0,4,7]), sub-grid Ticks(40) and frame-locked MilliHz(50000) rates, octave-multiply and cross-pitch legato.",
    "patterns": [
      {
        "id": 0,
        "name": "1. Accent + Ghost",
        "description": "Expression: accent (velocity x1.7 on the beats) vs ghost (forced-soft offbeats).",
